	The bugle is a musical instrument. (obviously)  Applying it will
usually cause monsters on the level to awaken, which is usually not desirable.
A mirror can be applied in the direction of a monster which may react to its
reflection.  Both of these items also can be used in specific points of the
game to greatly facilitate things.  More on that in a sec.

	A leash, as you could probably figure out, will keep Fido or Fluffy
from straying too far from you.  A figurine, when applied, creates a monster
of that particular type next to you.  Blessed ones will create tame monsters,
cursed ones hostile ones, and uncursed ones have the usual probability of
being peaceful.

